Error [E0910]: The `change note: String -> Label` migration on `Order` has no converter
  --> tests/ui/migration_change_no_converter.jet:7:1
    |
  7 | #PublishedSchema struct Order {
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A type change needs a way to turn an old value into a new one — old data already on disk is read through it
 Fix: Add an inline `via { (old) -> … }` to the `change` op, or declare `impl String -> Label { … }` in scope
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0910
